-- Necromancer (class 10) rider-fidelity batch (2026-10-23): the four
-- backlog items R1-R4.
--
--  R1 Unholy Shield 61084: -50% magic damage taken (aura 87) instead of
--     flat magic immunity; the harmful-magic block is module-side.
--  R2 Lich Armor 61085: hidden proc aura 61354 (melee hit taken) casts
--     the 30%/5 s slow 61355 on the attacker.
--  R3 Will of the Death Knight 61091: hidden Shadow damage spell 61356
